    "en": {
      "title": "Barbosa",
      "location": "Municipality at the northern end of the Aburrá Valley in Antioquia, part of the Valle de Aburrá Metropolitan Area.",
      "history": "Founded in 1795, Barbosa was known as Hatillo de Barbosa and by other rural names before consolidating its municipal life. Its location made it the northern gateway to the Aburrá Valley."
    },
